Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:45.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,复仇就要冷血
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:47.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,复仇就要冷血  克林昂古谚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.73,0:01:25.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我在玩性虐待吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you find me sadistic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:37.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我敢说现在我能在你头上煎个蛋...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know... l'll bet I could fry an egg on your head right now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:41.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我想的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if I wanted to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.60,0:01:45.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 小乖乖...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, kiddo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:49.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信即使现在你还很清醒...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l'd like to believe... you're aware enough,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.99,0:01:57.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道我不是在玩性虐待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even now...to know that there is nothing sadistic in my actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.09,0:02:03.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我会和那些无聊人玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe towards those other jokers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.07,0:02:07.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但不和你玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.63,0:02:14.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 小乖乖 现在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, kiddo at this moment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:19.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this is me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:22.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最痛苦的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...at my most masochistic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:27.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比尔 这是你的骨肉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill... it's your baby...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.83,0:02:42.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《杀死比尔：第一卷》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:12.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,[第一章：2]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:22.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(加州 巴沙迪那市)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.10,0:05:44.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.30,0:05:48.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莎菈 怎么这么早!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah, cannot believe you are early.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:52.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想干嘛 嗯?!有啥本事?!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you going to do now, huh?! What you got?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:55.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,饶不了你 准备好了吧! 来呀!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got your ass. Wrap it up! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.10,0:07:06.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 来呀 婊子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Come on, bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:09.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:11.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放马过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.29,0:07:53.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 妈咪 我回来了 - 嗨 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mommy, I'm home. - Hey, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.80,0:07:57.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,学校一切都好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was school?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.70,0:08:02.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈咪 你怎么啦 客厅怎么啦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy, what happened to you and the TV room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.80,0:08:07.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你那只专门捣蛋的狗跑进客厅来造反了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your good-for-nothing dog got into the living room and acted a damn fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:09.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就变成这样啦 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what happened baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:10.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是巴尼干的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barney did this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.50,0:08:12.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝 你不能过来这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby. Now, you can't come in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:15.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到处都是碎玻璃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's broken glass everywhere{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:19.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不小心会割到你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you could cut yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:26.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是妈咪好久没见的老朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is an old friend of Mommy's I ain't seen in a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.40,0:08:27.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 甜心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:32.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫(消音) 你叫什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm (BLEEP) What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:36.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她叫妮琪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her name is Nikki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.95,0:08:38.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妮琪...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nikki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.41,0:08:41.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,美丽的小姑娘 美丽的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a pretty name for such a pretty girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.14,0:08:45.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你几岁啦 妮琪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How old are you, Nikki?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.52,0:08:51.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妮琪...(消音)在问你话呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nikki. (BLEEP) asked you a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:54.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我四岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm 4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:08:57.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,四岁啦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}4 years old, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:09:02.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 我以前也有个女儿...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I had a ittle girl once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.56,0:09:05.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在也该四岁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'd be about 4 now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.30,0:09:14.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝 妈咪的朋友和我有些大人的事要谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now baby, me and Mommy's friend got some grown-up talk to talk about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:18.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你现在进房间去 直到我叫你出来为止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So go in your room now and leave us alone til I tell you to come out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.60,0:09:19.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.97,0:09:22.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妮琪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nikkia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.57,0:09:26.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在立刻进房间去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In your room. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:40.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来点咖啡吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want some coffee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:42.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:53.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这家女主人的名字是吉妮·贝尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This Pasadena homemaker's name is Jeanne Bell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.43,0:09:55.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她先生是劳伦斯·贝尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her husband is Dr. Lawrence Bell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.14,0:10:01.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过四年前我们认识的时候 她的名字叫芙妮塔·格林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But back when we were acquainted four years ago, her name was Vernita Green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:04.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她的代号是"铜头蛇"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her code name was Copperhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:05.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的代号是"黑曼巴"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine, Black Mamba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:06.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有纸巾吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a towel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:10.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:14.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.61,0:10:17.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 照旧加糖和奶精 对吧? - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You still take cream and sugar right? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:23.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想现在说抱歉大概太晚了 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So suppose it's a little late for an apology, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:25.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的很对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You suppose correctly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.92,0:10:27.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 婊子...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, bitch...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:30.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要知道你是否会在我宝贝女儿面前动手?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to know if you're going to start any more shit around my baby girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.06,0:10:32.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can relax for now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.33,0:10:37.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不会在孩子面前宰了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to murder you in front of your child, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:42.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你比比尔更理性一点 我想你也不会那样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's being more irational than Bill led me to believe you were capable of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:46.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我缺的是慈悲 同情 和宽恕...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's mercy, compassion and forgiveness lack...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.45,0:10:49.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而不是理性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...not irationality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:55.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:57.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我害了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I know I fucked you over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:11:01.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,害得你很惨 我希望我没做 但是我做了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fucked you over bad. I wish to God I hadn't, but I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:04.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有权利来讨回公道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have every right to want to get even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:06.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不...不是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No no, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.34,0:11:11.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,讨回公道?啥叫公道?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. To get even, even-steven...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.34,0:11:14.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得宰了你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have to kill you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.35,0:11:17.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再去宰了你女儿...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...go up to Nikkis room kill her...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:22.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后等你丈夫 好心的贝尔医生回家 再宰了他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...then wait for your husband, the good Dr. Bell, to come home and kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.69,0:11:27.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这才叫公道 我们才会谁也不欠谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be even Vernita That'd be about square.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:32.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 如果时光能倒流我一定不会做 但是这不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if I could go back in a machine, I would. But I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.47,0:11:37.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在只能说我已经重新做人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All can tell you is that I'm a different person now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.71,0:11:41.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 好极了 可我不在乎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh great. I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:46.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管如此 我知道我不配你的施舍与宽恕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be that as it may, I know I don't deserve your mercy or your forgiveness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:50.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是为了过去的事和我女儿 我求你宽恕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, I beseech you for both on behalf of my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:54.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,婊子 别说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitch, you can stop right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.83,0:11:58.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我不想在你女儿面前宰了你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just because I have no wish to murder you in front of your daughter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:12:03.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并不表示你拿她来做幌子 我就会同情你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...doesn't mean that parading her around in front of me will inspire sympathy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.74,0:12:07.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们来有一桩买卖未了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I have unfinished business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:11.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就算你这四年来 做尽了善事...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And not a goddamned thing you've done in the subsequent four years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:15.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何都不能使我改变心意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}. including getting knocked up is going to change that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.99,0:12:19.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那咱们什么何时了结?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So when do we do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.46,0:12:23.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛 就看你想什么时候死?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It all depends. When do you want to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:27.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明天?后天?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow? The day after tomorrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:30.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 今晚如何 婊子? - 好极了! 哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How about tonight, bitch? - Splendid. Where?{\r}
