Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.37,0:12:39.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们半夜两点半见 全身穿黑色衣服...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We meet there around 2:30 in the morning dressed all in black.{\r}
