Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.47,0:12:51.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得给妮琪准备一些干榖点心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I have to fix Nikkis cerieal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.09,0:13:03.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比尔总是说你是他见过最会用刀的女人之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill always said you were one of the best ladies with an edged weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:08.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去他妈的  他自己的剑术也不怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you bitch. I know he didn't qualify that shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.63,0:13:12.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就准备去见阎王吧 黑曼巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you can just kiss my motherfucking ass, Black Mamba.{\r}
