Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.33,0:13:21.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至于用什么刀?你就用以前的那种屠刀也行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapon of choice? If you want to stick with your butcher knife, that's fine by me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.77,0:13:24.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真好笑 婊子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very funny, bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:27.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真好笑!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.68,0:14:28.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是故意要在你面前下手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was not my intention to do this in front of you.{\r}
