Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.67,0:15:31.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,压抑所有人性里的情绪和同情...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suppress all human emotions and compassion...{\r}
