Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.36,0:41:25.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看我的脸鼻子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at my nose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.50,0:41:28.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看我的下巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at my chin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.30,0:41:32.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看我的嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at my mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.36,0:41:37.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,似曾相识吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I look familiar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.67,0:41:45.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是不是很像某个被你谋杀的人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I look like somebody you murdered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.77,0:42:53.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,20岁之前 她已成为世界顶尖的女杀手之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By 20, she was one of the top female assassins in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.15,0:43:46.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,25岁时她参与了一次行动 谋杀了9个无辜之人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At 25 she did her part in the killing of nine innocent people...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.33,0:43:49.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,包括我未出世的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... including my unborn daughter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.16,0:43:53.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在一个德州艾帕索市的小结婚教堂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... in a small wedding chapel in El Paso, Texas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.63,0:43:56.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但就在四年前的那天...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But on that day four years ago...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.20,0:44:00.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她犯了一个大错...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... she made one big mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.31,0:44:03.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当时她应该杀掉10个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She should have killed ten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.55,0:44:08.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然而 在我如愿以偿之前...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, before satisfaction would be mine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.05,0:44:10.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先要做的是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... first things first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.22,0:44:13.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,动一动 脚拇趾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wiggle your big toe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.04,0:44:22.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最难的一关过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard part's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.51,0:44:26.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 其他娃娃脚趾也动一动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, let's get these other piggies wiggling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.93,0:44:30.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(13小时之后)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.81,0:45:03.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来艾欧航空 需要帮忙吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Air O. May I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.92,0:45:06.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冲绳...单程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okinawa One-way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.96,0:45:12.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(冲绳)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.67,0:45:20.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,[第四章：冲绳男子]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.97,0:45:28.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(日本 冲绳岛)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.44,0:45:34.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.87,0:45:36.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.55,0:45:42.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.22,0:45:46.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是英国人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You English?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.39,0:45:48.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,几乎对了...是美国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost American.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.80,0:45:51.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,美国人 欢迎 欢迎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}American Welcome, welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.59,0:45:53.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多莫(你好){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.80,0:45:56.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的英语...很好哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My English very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.73,0:45:58.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚说"多莫"!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said "domo".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.27,0:45:59.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会说日文吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you speak Japanese?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.04,0:46:03.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不是啦 只是从昨天开始学的几个字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No no. Just a few words I learned since yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.64,0:46:09.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗯...我能坐寿司吧吗? - 当然 请坐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- May I sit at the bar? - Oh, sure Sure sure. Please, sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.15,0:46:15.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还学了其他什么字?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What other words did you learn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.05,0:46:18.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 请等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.15,0:46:22.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有客人 快上茶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a customer. Bring out some tea, quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.82,0:46:25.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在看连续剧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm watching my soap operas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.69,0:46:26.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.89,0:46:29.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,懒鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lazy bastard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.23,0:46:31.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去你妈的连续剧 快啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screw your soap opera... hurry up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.40,0:46:34.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,茶很烫 干脆你自己上一次茶吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The teas hot Why don't you serve it yourself for once?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.04,0:46:38.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 快给我滚出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up! Get your ass out here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.51,0:46:41.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请原谅我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.85,0:46:45.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还会说其他什么日语?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What other Japanese do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.97,0:46:50.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦...我想想...阿里嘎多(谢谢){\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, let's see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.04,0:46:52.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿里嘎多...嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.38,0:46:56.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚说过多莫 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already said domo, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.92,0:46:58.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 对 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.31,0:47:00.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抠尼几哇{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.77,0:47:04.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不对 抠尼奇哇(你好){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.42,0:47:05.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抠-尼-奇-哇 请跟我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please repeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.87,0:47:07.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抠尼奇哇{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.24,0:47:10.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 很好 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect. Good, good, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.26,0:47:12.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的就像日本人说的一样好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say Japanese word like you're Japanese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.00,0:47:17.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在嘲笑我吧 - 不 很正经的说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now you're making fun of me. - No. Serious business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.53,0:47:20.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发音很棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pronunciation very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.77,0:47:25.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说阿里嘎多 就像我们说阿里嘎多一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say ariga to. Like we say ariga to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.11,0:47:31.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你...我是说 阿里嘎多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thank you. I mean, ariga to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.25,0:47:37.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该学日语 很简单的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should learn Japanese. Very easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.79,0:47:41.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真的?我听说好像很难 - 是很难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No kidding? I heard it was kind of hard. - Most difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.06,0:47:44.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你很有天赋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, you have Japanese tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.64,0:47:54.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 老天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.78,0:48:01.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 怎么还没上茶? 快点 妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what the hell happened to the tea. Hurry up... goddamit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.16,0:48:07.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,又懒又蠢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lazy oaf...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.19,0:48:15.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要啥?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd ya want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.79,0:48:18.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beg your pardon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.10,0:48:21.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喝什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.73,0:48:25.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 对了 一壶温清酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes, a bottle of warm sake, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.74,0:48:29.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,温清酒?好的很{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warm sake? Very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.28,0:48:30.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一壶温清酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One warm sake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.88,0:48:33.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,清酒?大白天喝酒?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sake? In the middle of the day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.62,0:48:38.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,白天 晚上 日正午 谁在乎 去拿清酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Day, night afternoon Who gives a damn. Get the sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.96,0:48:41.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么每次都是我去拿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come I always have to get the sake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.86,0:48:43.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我听好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You listen well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.59,0:48:46.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三十年来都是你切鱼 我拿酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For thirty years you make the fish. I get the sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.97,0:48:52.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这里是皇军 我已经成了将军(清酒品牌){\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this were the military, I'd be General by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.37,0:48:55.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 你成了将军...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, so youd be General huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.34,0:48:59.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是将军 那我就是天皇啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you were General, I'd be Emperor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.31,0:49:04.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,结果还是你去拿酒 所以给我闭嘴 快去拿酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you'd stlll get the sake. So shut up and get the sake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.32,0:49:05.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听懂没?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.52,0:49:08.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是天生光头 是剃光的 你听懂没?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not bald, okay? I shaved my head. Do you under stand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.70,0:49:13.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.93,0:49:19.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 第一次来日本?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First time in Japan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.36,0:49:23.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么风把你吹来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What brings you to Okinawa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.27,0:49:25.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是来找一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Came to see a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.07,0:49:27.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.91,0:49:31.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有朋友住冲绳?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a friend live in Okinawa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.88,0:49:33.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not quite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.51,0:49:34.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是朋友?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.38,0:49:38.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们没见过面 - 没见过!?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I never met him. - Never?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.77,0:49:42.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁啊...我能冒昧的问吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is he may I ask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.55,0:49:45.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,服部半藏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hattori Hanzo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.06,0:50:01.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你找服部半藏干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want with Hattori Hanzo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.50,0:50:05.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要一把日本刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need Japanese steel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.36,0:50:10.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要日本刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you need Japanese steel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.00,0:50:15.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀一只黄鼠狼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have vermin to kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.18,0:50:23.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那一定是大老鼠 你才需要服部半藏武士刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have big rats you need Hattori Hanzo's steel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.45,0:50:27.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非常大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.95,0:51:57.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.19,0:51:59.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.83,0:52:03.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.57,0:52:06.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,试试上面第二把{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try the second one down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.90,0:53:01.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.94,0:53:04.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢武士刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you like samurai swords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.11,0:53:09.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢棒球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like baseball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.59,0:53:20.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想要让你看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to show you these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.03,0:53:26.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 像你见识这么广的人 也一定知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However someone as you, who knows so much, must surely know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.56,0:53:32.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经不再造杀人的武器了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... I no longer make instruments of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.73,0:53:42.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的一切 我留着只是为了艺术价值和过去的回忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I have here I keep for their aesthetic and sentimental value.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.91,0:53:47.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来 我当然很骄傲我一生的心血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet proud as I am of my life 's work...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.52,0:53:55.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我已经退休了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... I have retired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.36,0:54:05.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么就给我一把吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then give me one of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.56,0:54:07.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些是非卖品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are not for sale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.23,0:54:13.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没说"卖" 我是说"给"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't say "sell me" I said "give me".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.66,0:54:18.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么...我要帮助你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.17,0:54:23.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我的那只黄鼠狼 是你以前的徒弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because my vermin is a former student of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.48,0:54:28.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就因为他是你学生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And considering the student...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.95,0:54:34.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我说你有很大的责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say you have a rather large obligation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.92,0:55:20.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(比尔)
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.20,0:55:33.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以睡这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can sleep here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.94,0:55:37.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要一个月...来铸这把刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will take me a month to make the sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.04,0:55:43.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我建议你用这段时间来练习{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest you spend it practicing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.17,0:56:19.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(一个月后)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.92,0:57:15.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经做了一件...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've completed doing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.59,0:57:21.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,28年前我向神起誓...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what I swore an oath to God, 28 years ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.93,0:57:26.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不再做的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to never do again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.27,0:57:32.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我造了一个能杀人的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have created "something that kills peope."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.78,0:57:39.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就这一点来说 我是成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in that purpose, was a success.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.36,0:57:52.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我之所以做了 因为内心深处...我同情你的遭遇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've done this because philosophically, I am sympathetic to your aim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.57,0:58:00.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我吹牛 这是我铸过最好的一把刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can tell you with no ego, this is my finest sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.58,0:58:06.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,万一你的复仇之路 遇上了神...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If on your journey, you should encounter God...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.89,0:58:08.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,神也会被切两半{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...God will be cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.64,0:58:25.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黄发武士...去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yellow-haired warrior...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.05,0:58:27.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Domo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.60,0:58:47.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,[第五章：蓝叶茶室对决]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.60,0:58:53.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,德州艾帕索市惨案的一年后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was one year after the massacre in El Paso, Texas,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.38,0:58:57.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比尔给他的日本支系经济与精神上的援助...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Bill backed his Nippon progeny financially and philosophically in her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.25,0:59:01.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮助她与其他黑帮几乎是戏剧化的争夺...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shakespearean-in-magnitude power struggle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.49,0:59:04.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,整个东京黑社会的统治权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the other yakuza clans over who would rule vice in the city of Tokyo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.92,0:59:08.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当硝烟散尽后...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the final sword was sheathed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.33,0:59:11.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是石井尾莲和她强力的武装团...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was O-Ren Ishii and her powerful posse...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.33,0:59:15.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"疯狂88人组" 取得了胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the Crazy 88, that proved the victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.44,0:59:22.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尾莲右边那个美妇人 穿得像"星际旅行"里反派角色的那个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pretty lady to O-Ren's right, who's dressed like she's a villain on "Star Trek,"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.01,0:59:26.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是尾莲的律师 好友和少尉...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is O-Ren's lawyer, best friend, and second lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.05,0:59:30.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,法美混血儿 苏菲·法塔尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The half-French, half-Japanese Sofie Fatale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.29,0:59:34.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比尔的另一位得意门生...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another former protegee of Bill's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.06,0:59:41.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个穿学生制服的年轻女孩是尾莲的私人保镖...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The young girl in the school-girl uniform is O-Ren's personal bodyguard,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.50,0:59:44.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,17岁的夕张"勾勾"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}17-year-old Gogo Yubari.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.84,0:59:50.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,勾勾也许还年轻 但她年龄上所欠缺的 她用疯狂来弥补{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gogo may be young, but what she lacks in age, she makes up for in madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.65,0:59:53.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢法拉利吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like Ferraris?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.28,0:59:59.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,法拉利?意大利垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ferrari... italian trash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.40,1:00:09.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想干我吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to screw me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.37,1:00:15.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别笑 你想干我吗?想还是不想?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't laugh! Do you want to screw me, yes or no?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.31,1:00:17.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.31,1:00:22.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在如何 大男孩?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How 'bout now, big boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.89,1:00:26.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还想插入我么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you still wish to penetrate me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.92,1:00:30.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or is it I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.06,1:00:32.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经插入你了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who has penetrated you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.03,1:00:35.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明白我的意思了吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See what I mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.20,1:00:41.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个身着黑西装 戴着加藤面具的秃子是莫庄尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bald guy in the black suit and the Kato mask is Johnny Mo,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.81,1:00:46.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是尾莲私人军队"疯狂88人组"的上将军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the head general of O-Ren's personal army, the Crazy 88.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.11,1:00:50.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你在疑惑...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just in case you were wondering{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.45,1:00:54.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么一个中日混血的美国人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how could a half-breed Japanese-Chinese American{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.49,1:00:58.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能成为日本东京黑帮老大中的老大?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}become the boss of all bosses in Tokyo, Japan,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.36,1:01:00.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我告诉你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.96,1:01:03.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关于尾莲的血统和国籍...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The subject of O-Ren's blood and nationality{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.87,1:01:06.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一次成为议会的议题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}came up before the council only once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.70,1:01:11.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是在尾莲接管这罪恶的黑帮议会的当天晚上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The night O-Ren assumed power over the crime council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.84,1:01:16.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个一心一意想要破坏会议气氛的大佬田中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man who seems bound and determined to break the mood is Boss Tanaka.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.85,1:01:20.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,田中在想的是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what Boss Tanaka thinks is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.13,1:01:27.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,田中老大!你这疯狂的举动是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boss Tanaka! What's the meaning of this outburst?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.26,1:01:28.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是庆祝的时候!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a time for celebration!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.00,1:01:32.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到底在庆祝什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what exactly are we celebrating?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.60,1:01:35.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们光荣议会的堕落吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The perversion of our illustrious council?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.87,1:01:42.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,田中! 你疯了吗?我不会容忍这个的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tanaka, have you gone mad? I will not tolerate this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.45,1:01:45.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对我们的大姐无理 道歉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're disrespecting our sister! Apologize!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.78,1:01:51.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,田中君 你说的堕落是指什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tanaka-San, of what perversion do you speak?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.03,1:02:02.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的父亲和你们的父亲创建了这个议会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father... along with yours, and along with yours, started this council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.94,1:02:04.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当你们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And while...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.47,1:02:05.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,像笨驴般傻笑时...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you laugh like stupid donkeys...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.92,1:02:07.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们却在阴间哭泣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they weep in the afterlife...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.25,1:02:09.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.15,1:02:12.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伤心今天议会的堕落!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...over the perversion committed today!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.68,1:02:18.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,荒谬! 田中 侮辱了这个议会的是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outrageous! Tanaka, it is you who insults this council!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.19,1:02:19.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.33,1:02:21.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck face!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.66,1:02:23.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.63,1:02:31.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,田中似乎心里有话要说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tanaka obviously has something on his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.81,1:02:36.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何 请先让他说出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By all means, allow him to express it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.88,1:02:42.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要说的是关于这议会的堕落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak, of the perversion done to this council,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.02,1:02:45.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱它...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which I love...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.26,1:02:48.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,更胜我自己的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...more than my own chidren,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.79,1:02:53.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为让一个中日混血的美国婊子成为首脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...by making a Chinese Jap-American half breed bitch its leader!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.96,1:03:19.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了让你们明白我是多么严肃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that you understand how serious I am...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.80,1:03:23.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下面我要用英语说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm going to say this in English.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.20,1:03:38.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,作为你们的首领...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As your leader...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.30,1:03:45.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我时常用尊敬的态度鼓励你们... 提出对我领导方式的质疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I encourage you from time to time, and always in a respectful manner to question my logic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.71,1:03:50.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对于我认为是最明智的决定 你们如果不信服的话 请告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're unconvinced a particular plan of action I've decided is the wisest, tell me so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.45,1:03:52.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也请给我机会来说服你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But allow me to convince you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.15,1:03:57.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在在这里向你们保证 没有不可以谈的议题...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And promise you, right here and now, no subject will ever be taboo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.02,1:04:01.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了现在正在讨论的议题之外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except, of course, the subject that was just under discussion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.83,1:04:05.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要付出的代价是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The price you pay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.53,1:04:10.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对于我的中美血统有任何负面的评价...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for bringing up either my Chinese or American heritage as a negative is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.27,1:04:12.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就会取你的首级{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I collect your fucking head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.94,1:04:14.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像这个混蛋一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like this fucker here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.38,1:04:21.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们这群龟儿子还有什么话要说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if any of you sons of bitches got anything else to say,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.08,1:04:24.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在正是时候!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now is the fucking time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.76,1:04:28.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.50,1:04:33.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位 现在散会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, this meeting is adjourned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.60,1:04:36.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去东京一张单程机票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One ticket to Tokyo pease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.13,1:09:34.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,勾勾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gogo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.17,1:11:52.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对于他们任何无理的要求 你都要说 "是 是 是 "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to say "Yes, yes, yes" to any selfish demands they make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.17,1:11:54.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的要求真的很荒谬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They demand ridiculous things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.24,1:11:56.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴! 你知道如果他们听到了 你会怎么样吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up... Do you know what would happen if they heard you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.58,1:11:58.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 会发生什么 - 你没听说田中帮吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's gonna happen?  - Did you hear about the Tanaka clan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.08,1:12:00.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的头会被砍掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna get your head chopped off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.94,1:12:51.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.35,1:12:58.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你给我们一个联系号码 我们会回覆的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you give us a contact number, we will get back to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.30,1:13:17.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你让我想起谁吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you remind me of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.94,1:13:19.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,查理布朗!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie Brown!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.81,1:13:23.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 他确实长得像查理布朗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right, he does look like Charlie Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.62,1:13:26.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,查理布朗 4个香肠匹萨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie Brown. Four pepperoni pizzas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.65,1:13:30.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们菜单上没有 - 我不管 去拿来 妈的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's not on our menu... - I don't care, bring them, goddammit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.59,1:13:34.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂...喂...查理 给我一个吻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey... hey... Charlie, give me a kiss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.00,1:13:37.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,石井尾莲!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O-Ren Ishii!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.97,1:13:41.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我还有些恩怨未了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I have unfinished business!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.52,1:14:13.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.31,1:15:14.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,查理不朗 滚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie Brown, beat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.62,1:15:22.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,米奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.05,1:15:42.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把这婊子给剁了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}TEAR THE BITCH APART!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.33,1:17:14.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说 尾莲...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, O-Ren,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.00,1:17:18.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还有属下来送死吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anymore subordinates for me to kill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.44,1:17:21.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.34,1:17:24.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,勾勾 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gogo, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.31,1:17:29.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,答对啦 你是黑曼巴?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bingo. And you're Black Mamba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.68,1:17:35.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的名声响亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our reputations precede us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.16,1:17:37.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.46,1:17:40.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,勾勾...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gogo,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.50,1:17:44.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你必须保护女主人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you feel you must protect your mistress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.74,1:17:47.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我乞求你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I beg you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.44,1:17:49.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快让开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walk away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.02,1:17:59.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这叫乞求?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call that begging?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.06,1:18:07.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该哀求才对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can beg better than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.68,1:21:23.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我想的一样吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what I think it is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.25,1:21:26.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会认为有那么简单 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't think it was gonna be that easy, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.65,1:21:29.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 我当时...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, for a second there, yeah,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.22,1:21:33.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,的确是这么认为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kind of did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.50,1:21:36.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,傻孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silly rabbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.93,1:21:38.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子才会这样想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trix are for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.84,1:28:11.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你混黑道的下场!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what you get for fucking around with yakuzas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.48,1:28:14.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,滚回家找你妈妈去吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go home to your mother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.02,1:29:18.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些侥幸还活着的 快逃命去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those of you lucky enough to still have your lives... take them with you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.23,1:29:21.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.87,1:29:26.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,留下你们的断肢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...leave the limbs you've lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.97,1:29:31.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们现在是我的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They belong to me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.28,1:29:38.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了你 苏菲!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except you, Sofie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.49,1:29:42.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你待在原地别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stay right where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.22,1:30:38.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的兵器令人印象深刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your instrument is quite impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.26,1:30:45.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪里造的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where was it made?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.68,1:30:47.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冲绳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okinawa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.14,1:30:53.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是冲绳什么人打造的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whom in Okinawa made you this steel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.28,1:30:56.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是服部半藏的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Hattori Hanzo steel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.28,1:30:57.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说谎!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}YOU LIE!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.50,1:31:12.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然刀剑不会累{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swords however, never get tired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.04,1:31:17.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你还留有足够的精力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope you've saved your energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.21,1:31:22.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you haven't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.51,1:31:26.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你撑不了五分钟的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you might not last five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.59,1:31:31.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从刚才的情况来看...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as last looks go,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.92,1:31:33.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会更惨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you could do worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.75,1:34:17.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这傻傻的白人女孩 却偏偏爱玩日本武士刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silly Caucasian girl likes to play with samurai swords.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.56,1:34:22.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你虽然不能像武士般打斗...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may not be able to fight like a samurai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.67,1:34:28.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你却可以死得像个武士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can at least die like a samurai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.01,1:35:00.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放马过来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attack me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.71,1:35:03.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尽你所能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with everything you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.65,1:36:01.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才看轻你了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For ridiculing you earlier...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.88,1:36:05.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我道歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I apologize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.46,1:36:15.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我接受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accepted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.25,1:36:33.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.26,1:36:39.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.67,1:37:21.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那真的是一把服部半藏的刀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That really was a Hattori Hanzo sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.84,1:39:29.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,苏菲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sofie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.11,1:39:31.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,苏菲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sofie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.95,1:39:35.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的苏菲 真对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Sofie. I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.45,1:39:42.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请 请宽恕我的背叛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Please forgive my betrayal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.96,1:39:44.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要再提了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.96,1:39:46.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But still...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.86,1:39:49.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么可但是的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But still nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.07,1:39:57.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了我为了她对我聪慧的苏菲做的一切而感到心痛之外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except my aching heart over what she's done to my beautiful and brilliant Sofie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.48,1:40:01.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我让你活着有两个原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've kept you alive for two reasons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.48,1:40:03.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第一 要问你话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first reason is information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.92,1:40:09.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧 你这愚蠢的金发女人 我什么也不会说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burn in Hell, you stupid, stupid blonde! I'll tell you nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.53,1:40:14.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我还是要问你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I am gonna ask you questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.80,1:40:18.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每次你不回答的话...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every time you don't give me answers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.90,1:40:21.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就从你身上割点什么下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna cut something off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.31,1:40:24.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I promise you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.68,1:40:28.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是你最怕失去的部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they will be things you will miss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.60,1:40:31.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我你的另一只手!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your other arm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.34,1:40:38.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要所有有关致命毒蛇成员们的信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want all the information on the Deadly Vipers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.15,1:40:40.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 如果让你猜... - 他们在干嘛...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If you had to guess... - What they've been doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.32,1:40:43.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她为什么要留你活口 - 在哪里可以找到他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why she left you alive...  - And where I can find them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.65,1:40:45.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的猜测是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would be your guess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.66,1:40:49.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要猜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guessing won't be necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.53,1:40:52.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她已经告诉我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She informed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.67,1:40:59.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她说我可以因为二个原因而保留我邪恶的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said I could keep my wicked life for two reasons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.61,1:41:00.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,像我以前说的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I said before,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.88,1:41:05.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我因为二个原因而让你继续你邪恶的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've allowed you to keep your wicked life for two reasons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.84,1:41:08.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第二个原因是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the second reason is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.35,1:41:13.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以亲口告诉他 今晚这里发生什么事...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you can tell him, in person, everything that happened here tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.12,1:41:18.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要他亲眼见证我的慈悲...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want him to witness the extent of my mercy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.49,1:41:21.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从你残破的身躯上看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by witnessing your deformed body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.20,1:41:26.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你告诉他所有你告诉我的讯息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to tell him all the information you just told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.44,1:41:29.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要他知道我所知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want him to know what I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.57,1:41:33.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要他知道我想要他知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want him to know I want him to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.85,1:41:36.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要他们全部都知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want them all to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.51,1:41:41.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们将会像尾莲一样死去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'll all soon be as dead as O-Ren.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.22,1:42:11.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,复仇不是一条直路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Revenge is never a straight line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.09,1:42:15.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而是一片森林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.03,1:42:19.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像在森林里容易迷路...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And like a forest it's easy to lose your way...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.17,1:42:24.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迷失了方向也忘了从哪里进来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to get lost... to forget where you came in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.91,1:42:29.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.88,1:42:31.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有报仇的权力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}deserves her revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.09,1:42:38.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.29,1:42:41.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we deserve to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.86,1:42:49.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她应该受折磨直到咽下最后一口气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She must suffer to her last breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.58,1:43:03.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么找到我的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you find me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.59,1:43:05.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了我是什么人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.33,1:43:12.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一件事 苏菲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more thing, Sofie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.80,1:43:17.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她知不知道她女儿还活着?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she aware her daughter is still aive?{\r}
